  "report_period": "Week 41 (4th Oct to 11th Oct 2024)",
  "commentary": {
    "bulkers": "Ever Stella Shipping have committed the Capesize \"Stella Hope\" 180/2016 Dalian, China (SS/DD 09/2026, BWTS fitted) was committed to clients of GENCO at mid USD 47 mill. Note that back in July, the \"Herun Global\" 181/2016 SWS, China (SS 08/2026, DD 12/2024, BWTS fitted) was sold at USD 49,5 mill. Premuda's Kamsarmax \"PS Cadiz\" 82/2010 Tsuneishi Zhoushan, China (SS/DD 05/2025, BWTS fitted) was committed to clients of Pioneer Marine at USD 16,8 mill. For comparison, the sister vessel \"Oasea\" 82/2010 Tsuneishi Zhoushan, China (SS/DD 01/2025, BWTS fitted) was sold back in May at USD 20,25 mill. The Ultramax \"Beechgate\" 63/2019 Iwagi, Japan (SS 03/2029, DD 04/2027, BWTS fitted) of Zodiac Maritime was committed to clients of Meghna at USD 35,6 mill. Remind you that back in July, the one-year-younger sister vessel \"Jal Kamal\" 63/2020 Imabari, Japan (SS/DD 02/2025, BWTS fitted) was sold at USD 37,75 mill. In addition, the older \"Nord Adriatic\" 61/2016 Iwagi, Japan (SS/DD 04/2026, BWTS fitted) was committed at USD 29,1 mill. On the Supramax sector, the \"NPS Mosa\" 53/2007 Iwagi, Japan (SS 06/2027, DD 12/2024, BWTS fitted) was committed to Korean interests at high USD 12 mill, while the sister vessel \"A Wisdom\" 53/2007 Iwagi, Japan (SS/DD 12/2024, BWTS fitted) was committed a week ago at low USD 13 mill. Following the sale of the Handysize \"Maple Fortitude\" 32/2011 Taizhou, China (SS/DD 03/2026, BWTS fitted) at region USD 11 mill, Maple Leaf Shipping have now committed the one-year-older sister vessel \"Maple Fortune\" 32/2010 Taizhou, China (SS/DD 05/2025, BWTS fitted) at USD 11 mill also.",
    "tankers": "Premuda have committed their DPP LR2 \"PS Genova\" 109/2010 Hudong- Zhonghua, China (SS/DD 05/2025, BWTS fitted) to UAE based interests at region USD 40 mill. For reference, the Aframax \"Claret Prince\" 109/2010 Hudong-Zhonghua, China (SS/DD 01/2025, BWTS & Scrubber fitted) was committed back in April at USD 43,5 mill. The MR2 \"Butterfly\" 46/2004 Stx, Korea (SS 01/2029, DD 10/2026, BWTS fitted) of IMS was committed to Chinese interests at region USD 18 mill. Remind you that back in June, the one-year-older sister vessel \"Sure\" 46/2003 Stx, Korea (SS 03/2028, DD 09/2026, BWTS fitted) was sold at excess USD 13 mill.",
    "freight": {
      "Capesize": "Iron ore rates on the West Australia / China route continued throughout",
      "Kamsarmax / Panamax": "North Pacific rounds ranged at the usd 12,000/15,000 pd. A number of Indonesian and Australian trips into China were reported at the level of usd 13,000/16,000 pd. A number of and Australian trips into India were fixed around usd 15,000/17,000 pd. South East Asian trips via East Coast South America into China were reported at the level of usd 14,000/15,000 pd. Indian trips via East Coast South America into China were fixed around usd 14,000/16,000 pd. South American trips into Mediterranean were reported at the level of usd 19,000/20,000 pd. South American trips into China were fixed around usd 15,000/17,000 pd plus ballast bonus at the usd 500K/700K. No period activity to report here.",
      "Ultramax / Supramax": "A generally quiet week for this segment. A number of Indonesian trips into China were reported at the level of usd 13,000/16,000 pd. Arabian Gulf trips into East Coast India were fixed around usd 16,000/17,000 pd. South African trips into West Coast India were reported at the level of usd 15,000/16,000 pd plus ballast bonus at the usd 150K/160K. Continental trips into Mediterranean were fixed around usd 15,000/17,000 pd. No period activity to report here.",
      "Handymax / Handysize": "North Pacific rounds ranged at the usd 14,000/16,000 pd. Continental trips into North Coast South America were fixed around usd 9,000/10,000 pd. Fronthaul trips from US East Coast were reported at the level of usd 20,000 pd. South American trips into Continent were fixed around usd 12,000/13,000 pd. East Coast South American trips into US East Coast were reported at the level of usd 11,000/13,000 pd. West Coast Central American trips via West Coast Canada into Far East were fixed around usd 13,000/15,000 pd. No period activity to report here."
    }
  },
